    "title": "Tupelo Police Issue Public Safety Advisory Amid Rise in Fentanyl Activity - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Morgan Howard ,\n7 hours ago The Tupelo Police Department is asking residents to stay vigilant following a recent uptick in fentanyl-related activity across North Mississippi. Law enforcement agencies report increases in both the purity and potency of fentanyl seized, particularly in areas tied to the Memphis drug supply line—trends that often spill into the Tupelo area. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
